    <string name="HELP_SECTION">Thanks for stopping by, parents! NameOfTheGame is free to download and play. You can open up bonus content for even more fun by purchasing NameOfTheSoftCurrency and NameOfTheHardCurrency. If thats not cool with you, you can control this kind of transaction for your kids simply by adjusting your device settings. Just like that, you have total control over what can or cant be bought in the game. Note that it is Gamelofts policy to put a cap on in-app purchases to prevent accidental or duplicate purchases.</string>
    <string name="HELP_SECTION_AMAZON">A great way to prevent accidental in-app purchases is to require your Amazon password before making any. Just follow these quick steps: - Go to the Amazon Appstore &gt;&gt; Press the Menu Key &gt;&gt; Settings &gt;&gt; Parental Controls - Set Enable Parental Controls to On (youll be asked to enter your existing Amazon password)\nNaturally, its a good idea to keep your password a secret, even from your kids. Note that it is Gamelofts policy to put a cap on in-app purchases to prevent accidental or duplicate purchases.</string>
    <string name="HELP_SECTION_GOOGLEPLAY">Passwords are a great way to make sure nobody but you can make in-app purchases on Google Play. Here are some quick steps to do this: - Go to Google Play &gt;&gt; Press the Menu Key &gt;&gt; Settings &gt;&gt; User Controls - Select Use PIN for Purchases or Password (you will be asked to enter your password) Naturally, its a good idea to keep your password a secret, even from your kids.\nPlease review your devices user manual or contact your device manufacturer for additional information. Note that it is Gamelofts policy to put a cap on in-app purchases to prevent accidental or duplicate purchases.</string>
    <string name="HELP_SECTION_WITHOUT_SOFTCURRENCY">Thanks for stopping by, parents! [Name of the game] is free to download and play. You can open up bonus content for even more fun by purchasing NameOfTheHardCurrency. If thats not cool with you, you can control this kind of transaction for your kids simply by adjusting your device settings. Just like that, you have total control over what can or cant be bought in the game.</string>
